# Two video screens combine texture playback, spatial audio and emissive mesh lighting.
# Press Play and focus the Game panel; P switches between bunny orbit and free flight.
# WASD moves, RMB looks or orbits, Shift boosts speed, and the wheel adjusts orbit distance.
# Assets/Scripts/CSharp/VideoGallery.cs controls the bunny, camera and canvas labels.
# Each screen owns a VideoComponent and audio settings; the bunny carries the listener.
# The bundled MP4 clips are shared resources referenced from Resources/Video/Demos.

